# save 00 (as c1_crystal_to_elephant) (story 1, Forbidden Island ST1D sub 1): walk up to the crystal's pedestal and use it
calm
go 512 4300 48
go 512 4400 24
tap circle
wait 4
tap circle
# script 0x28: the floor gives way, the fall into the arena (ST1D sub 2), the elephant wakes
mash
# the elephant (ST1D sub 2): lock-on on the boss (aim) + buster until flag 0x682; script 0x29 -> ST1C sub 0.
# The segment starts from save 00 again (the crystal, as c1): a save made in the arena does not restart the fight
# on load (the original: no elephant, nothing to lock on, 6000 ticks idle).
calm
fight 0x682 8000 aim
mash
